金失侯。後八歲，以浮沮將軍出五原二千餘里，無功。後八歲，以太僕為丞相，封葛繹侯。賀七為將軍，出擊匈奴無大功，而再侯，為丞相。坐子敬聲與陽石公主姦，為巫蠱，族滅，無後。"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-shiji111-224:a001","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-111-wei-huo:p028","start":195,"end":197,"surface":"公主","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-111-wei-huo:m028-0193","usage":"narrative","date_expression":null}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"保存此段原稱與具體用稱錨點；未知起訖不推定，回顧不作另一次授任。相對紀年尚待與明示年號的平行事件逐項核對，不以排列順序或卒年補任期。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-111-wei-huo:p028","text":"將軍公孫賀。賀，義渠人，其先胡種。賀父渾邪，景帝時為平曲侯，坐法失侯。賀，武帝為太子時舍人。武帝立八歲，以太僕為輕車將軍，軍馬邑。後四歲，以輕車將軍出雲中。後五歲，以騎將軍從大將軍有功，封為南窌侯。後一歲，以左將軍再從大將軍出定襄，無功。後四歲，以坐酎金失侯。後八歲，以浮沮將軍出五原二千餘里，無功。後八歲，以太僕為丞相，封葛繹侯。賀七為將軍，出擊匈奴無大功，而再侯，為丞相。坐子敬聲與陽石公主姦，為巫蠱，族滅，無後。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-111-wei-huo:m028-0002","start":2,"end":5,"surface":"公孫賀","kind":"person","person_id":"yg8_c3n_vv4","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-111-wei-huo:m028-0006","start":6,"end":7,"surface":"賀","kind":"person","person_id":"yg8_c3n_vv4","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-111-wei-huo:m028-0012","start":12,"end":16,"surface":"其先胡種","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-111-wei-huo:m028-0017","start":17,"end":18,"surface":"賀","kind":"person","person_id":"yg8_c3n_vv4","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-111-wei-huo:m028-0019","start":19,"end":21,"surface":"渾邪","kind":"person","person_id":"yay_w6f_lis","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-111-wei-huo:m028-0022","start":22,"end":24,"surface":"景帝","kind":"person","person_id":"eyb_jow_mdk","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-111-wei-huo:m028-